Note, Word Predictor MLP Web Training Server.

Note, Settings with defaults.
Let vocab limit be 200.
Let whole tok be 1.
Let min pair cnt be 1.
Let ctx be 3.
Let embed dim be 16.
Let hidden dim be 32.
Let num steps be 5000.
Let batch sz be 8.
Let halt mode be steps.
Let learn rate be 0 point 05.
Let target loss val be 0 point 5.
Let sem flag be 0.
Let sem anchor be the.
Let sem win be 2.
Let sem scale be 0 point 1.
Let space tok be 0.

Note, Data.
Create a list called vocab words.
Create a dictionary called vocab map.
Let vocab sz be 0.
Create a list called token ids.
Let training text be empty.

Note, Model weights.
Create a list called embed wts.
Create a list called hidden wts.
Create a list called hidden bias.
Create a list called out wts.
Create a list called out bias.

Note, Forward cache.
Create a list called input vec.
Create a list called hidden act.
Create a list called pre act.
Create a list called logits.
Create a list called probs.
Create a list called ctx tokens.

Note, Training state.
Let input dim be 0.
Let now training be no.
Let should halt be no.
Let all done be no.
Let current step be 0.
Let total steps be 0.
Let epoch loss be 0.
Let coherence val be 0.
Let current lr be 0.
Let param count be 0.
Let total toks be 0.
Create a list called all losses.
Create a list called all cohs.

Note, JSON key constants.
Let kdata be data.
Let ktext be text.
Let kvocablimit be vocablimit.
Let kwholetokens be wholetokens.
Let kminpaircount be minpaircount.
Let kcontext be context.
Let kembeddim be embeddim.
Let khiddendim be hiddendim.
Let ksteps be steps.
Let kbatchsize be batchsize.
Let klearningrate be learningrate.
Let kstopmode be stopmode.
Let ktargetloss be targetloss.
Let ksemanticinit be semanticinit.
Let ksemanticanchor be semanticanchor.
Let ksemanticscale be semanticscale.
Let kseed be seed.
Let kcount be count.
Note, Response key constants.
Let kvocabsz be vocabsz.
Let ktotaltokens be totaltokens.
Let kparams be params.
Let kstep be step.
Let ktotal be total.
Let kloss be loss.
Let kcoh be coh.
Let klr be lr.
Let klosses be losses.
Let kcohs be cohs.
Let kdone be done.
Let kvocab be vocab.
Let kmsg be msg.
Let kerror be error.

Note, Build vocabulary from training text.
Define build vocab,
    Create a list called raw tokens.
    If the value of whole tok is equal to 1,
        Set raw tokens to the split of training text by space.
    End if.
    If the value of whole tok is equal to 0,
        Let tlen be the length of training text.
        Let ci be 1.
        While the value of ci is less than or equal to tlen,
            Let ch be the substring of training text from the value of ci to the value of ci.
            Add the value of ch to raw tokens.
            Add 1 to ci.
        End while.
    End if.
    If the value of space tok is equal to 1,
        If the value of whole tok is equal to 1,
            Create a list called spaced tokens.
            Let ri be 1.
            While the value of ri is less than or equal to the length of raw tokens,
                Let tok be item ri of raw tokens.
                Add the value of tok to spaced tokens.
                Let rlen be the length of raw tokens.
                If the value of ri is less than rlen,
                    Add space to spaced tokens.
                End if.
                Add 1 to ri.
            End while.
            Set raw tokens to the value of spaced tokens.
        End if.
    End if.
    Create a dictionary called freq dict.
    Let ri be 1.
    While the value of ri is less than or equal to the length of raw tokens,
        Let tok be item ri of raw tokens.
        If the value of freq dict has the entry the value of tok,
            Let old cnt be the entry the value of tok in freq dict.
            Let new cnt be the value of old cnt plus 1.
            Set the entry the value of tok in freq dict to the value of new cnt.
        Otherwise,
            Set the entry the value of tok in freq dict to 1.
        End if.
        Add 1 to ri.
    End while.
    Set vocab sz to 0.
    Create a list called nv words.
    Create a dictionary called nv map.
    Let freq keys be the keys of freq dict.
    Let ki be 1.
    While the value of ki is less than or equal to the length of freq keys,
        Let tok be item ki of freq keys.
        Let cnt be the entry the value of tok in freq dict.
        If the value of cnt is greater than or equal to min pair cnt,
            If the value of vocab sz is less than vocab limit,
                Add 1 to vocab sz.
                Add the value of tok to nv words.
                Set the entry the value of tok in nv map to the value of vocab sz.
            End if.
        End if.
        Add 1 to ki.
    End while.
    Set vocab words to the value of nv words.
    Set vocab map to the value of nv map.
    Create a list called new tids.
    Let ri be 1.
    While the value of ri is less than or equal to the length of raw tokens,
        Let tok be item ri of raw tokens.
        If the value of nv map has the entry the value of tok,
            Let tid be the entry the value of tok in nv map.
            Add the value of tid to new tids.
        End if.
        Add 1 to ri.
    End while.
    Set token ids to the value of new tids.
    Set total toks to the length of token ids.
End define.

Note, Initialize model weights with random values.
Define init model,
    Set input dim to the value of ctx times embed dim.
    Create a list called ne.
    Let total e be the value of vocab sz times embed dim.
    Let wi be 1.
    While the value of wi is less than or equal to total e,
        Let w be a random decimal between negative 0 point 1 and 0 point 1.
        Add the value of w to ne.
        Add 1 to wi.
    End while.
    Set embed wts to the value of ne.
    Create a list called nhw.
    Let total h be the value of hidden dim times input dim.
    Let wi be 1.
    While the value of wi is less than or equal to total h,
        Let w be a random decimal between negative 0 point 1 and 0 point 1.
        Add the value of w to nhw.
        Add 1 to wi.
    End while.
    Set hidden wts to the value of nhw.
    Create a list called nhb.
    Let wi be 1.
    While the value of wi is less than or equal to hidden dim,
        Add 0 to nhb.
        Add 1 to wi.
    End while.
    Set hidden bias to the value of nhb.
    Create a list called now.
    Let total o be the value of vocab sz times hidden dim.
    Let wi be 1.
    While the value of wi is less than or equal to total o,
        Let w be a random decimal between negative 0 point 1 and 0 point 1.
        Add the value of w to now.
        Add 1 to wi.
    End while.
    Set out wts to the value of now.
    Create a list called nob.
    Let wi be 1.
    While the value of wi is less than or equal to vocab sz,
        Add 0 to nob.
        Add 1 to wi.
    End while.
    Set out bias to the value of nob.
    Set param count to the value of total e plus total h plus hidden dim plus total o plus vocab sz.
End define.

Note, Semantic embedding initialization.
Define do semantic init,
    Create a dictionary called anchor map.
    If not the value of vocab map has the entry the value of sem anchor,
        Return 0.
    End if.
    Let anchor idx be the entry the value of sem anchor in vocab map.
    Let num toks be the length of token ids.
    Let ti be 1.
    While the value of ti is less than or equal to num toks,
        Let tid be item ti of token ids.
        If the value of tid is equal to anchor idx,
            Let lo be the value of ti minus sem win.
            If the value of lo is less than 1,
                Set lo to 1.
            End if.
            Let hi be the value of ti plus sem win.
            If the value of hi is greater than num toks,
                Set hi to the value of num toks.
            End if.
            Let ni be the value of lo.
            While the value of ni is less than or equal to hi,
                If the value of ni is not equal to ti,
                    Let ntid be item ni of token ids.
                    Let ntid key be the value of ntid.
                    If the value of anchor map has the entry the value of ntid key,
                        Let old val be the entry the value of ntid key in anchor map.
                        Let nval be the value of old val plus 1.
                        Set the entry the value of ntid key in anchor map to the value of nval.
                    Otherwise,
                        Set the entry the value of ntid key in anchor map to 1.
                    End if.
                End if.
                Add 1 to ni.
            End while.
        End if.
        Add 1 to ti.
    End while.
    Let vi be 1.
    While the value of vi is less than or equal to vocab sz,
        Let vi key be the value of vi.
        Let cooc be 0.
        If the value of anchor map has the entry the value of vi key,
            Set cooc to the entry the value of vi key in anchor map.
        End if.
        If the value of cooc is greater than 0,
            Let ei be 1.
            While the value of ei is less than or equal to embed dim,
                Let vimo be the value of vi minus 1.
                Let epos be the value of vimo times embed dim plus ei.
                Let old e be item epos of embed wts.
                Let bump be the value of cooc times sem scale divided by embed dim.
                Let new e be the value of old e plus bump.
                Set item epos of embed wts to the value of new e.
                Add 1 to ei.
            End while.
        End if.
        Add 1 to vi.
    End while.
End define.

Note, Forward pass.
Define do forward,
    Create a list called niv.
    Let ci be 1.
    While the value of ci is less than or equal to ctx,
        Let tok be item ci of ctx tokens.
        Let tokmo be the value of tok minus 1.
        Let emb off be the value of tokmo times embed dim.
        Let ei be 1.
        While the value of ei is less than or equal to embed dim,
            Let wpos be the value of emb off plus ei.
            Let val be item wpos of embed wts.
            Add the value of val to niv.
            Add 1 to ei.
        End while.
        Add 1 to ci.
    End while.
    Set input vec to the value of niv.
    Create a list called nha.
    Create a list called npa.
    Let hi be 1.
    While the value of hi is less than or equal to hidden dim,
        Let acc be 0.
        Let ii be 1.
        While the value of ii is less than or equal to input dim,
            Let himo be the value of hi minus 1.
            Let wpos be the value of himo times input dim plus ii.
            Let hw be item wpos of hidden wts.
            Let iv be item ii of niv.
            Let prod be the value of hw times iv.
            Set acc to the value of acc plus prod.
            Add 1 to ii.
        End while.
        Let hb be item hi of hidden bias.
        Set acc to the value of acc plus hb.
        Add the value of acc to npa.
        If the value of acc is less than 0,
            Set acc to 0.
        End if.
        Add the value of acc to nha.
        Add 1 to hi.
    End while.
    Set hidden act to the value of nha.
    Set pre act to the value of npa.
    Create a list called nlogits.
    Let oi be 1.
    While the value of oi is less than or equal to vocab sz,
        Let acc be 0.
        Let hi be 1.
        While the value of hi is less than or equal to hidden dim,
            Let oimo be the value of oi minus 1.
            Let wpos be the value of oimo times hidden dim plus hi.
            Let ow be item wpos of out wts.
            Let ha be item hi of nha.
            Let prod be the value of ow times ha.
            Set acc to the value of acc plus prod.
            Add 1 to hi.
        End while.
        Let ob be item oi of out bias.
        Set acc to the value of acc plus ob.
        Add the value of acc to nlogits.
        Add 1 to oi.
    End while.
    Set logits to the value of nlogits.
    Let max logit be the max of nlogits.
    Create a list called nprobs.
    Let exp total be 0.
    Let ki be 1.
    While the value of ki is less than or equal to vocab sz,
        Let logit be item ki of nlogits.
        Let shifted be the value of logit minus max logit.
        Let ex be the exponential of the value of shifted.
        Add the value of ex to nprobs.
        Set exp total to the value of exp total plus ex.
        Add 1 to ki.
    End while.
    Let ki be 1.
    While the value of ki is less than or equal to vocab sz,
        Let p be item ki of nprobs.
        Let normed be the value of p divided by exp total.
        Set item ki of nprobs to the value of normed.
        Add 1 to ki.
    End while.
    Set probs to the value of nprobs.
End define.

Note, Backward pass.
Define do backward that takes tgt idx and lr,
    Create a list called d out.
    Let oi be 1.
    While the value of oi is less than or equal to vocab sz,
        Let p be item oi of probs.
        If the value of oi is equal to tgt idx,
            Let grad be the value of p minus 1.
        Otherwise,
            Let grad be the value of p.
        End if.
        Add the value of grad to d out.
        Add 1 to oi.
    End while.
    Let oi be 1.
    While the value of oi is less than or equal to vocab sz,
        Let dg be item oi of d out.
        Let hi be 1.
        While the value of hi is less than or equal to hidden dim,
            Let oimo be the value of oi minus 1.
            Let wpos be the value of oimo times hidden dim plus hi.
            Let old w be item wpos of out wts.
            Let ha be item hi of hidden act.
            Let grad step be the value of dg times ha times lr.
            Let new w be the value of old w minus grad step.
            Set item wpos of out wts to the value of new w.
            Add 1 to hi.
        End while.
        Let old b be item oi of out bias.
        Let b step be the value of dg times lr.
        Let new b be the value of old b minus b step.
        Set item oi of out bias to the value of new b.
        Add 1 to oi.
    End while.
    Create a list called d emb.
    Let total e be the value of ctx times embed dim.
    Let di be 1.
    While the value of di is less than or equal to total e,
        Add 0 to d emb.
        Add 1 to di.
    End while.
    Let hi be 1.
    While the value of hi is less than or equal to hidden dim,
        Let dh be 0.
        Let oi be 1.
        While the value of oi is less than or equal to vocab sz,
            Let dg be item oi of d out.
            Let oimo be the value of oi minus 1.
            Let wpos be the value of oimo times hidden dim plus hi.
            Let ow be item wpos of out wts.
            Let ctr be the value of ow times dg.
            Set dh to the value of dh plus ctr.
            Add 1 to oi.
        End while.
        Let pa be item hi of pre act.
        If the value of pa is less than or equal to 0,
            Set dh to 0.
        End if.
        Let ii be 1.
        While the value of ii is less than or equal to input dim,
            Let himo be the value of hi minus 1.
            Let wpos be the value of himo times input dim plus ii.
            Let old w be item wpos of hidden wts.
            Let iv be item ii of input vec.
            Let grad step be the value of dh times iv times lr.
            Let new w be the value of old w minus grad step.
            Set item wpos of hidden wts to the value of new w.
            Add 1 to ii.
        End while.
        Let old b be item hi of hidden bias.
        Let hb step be the value of dh times lr.
        Let new b be the value of old b minus hb step.
        Set item hi of hidden bias to the value of new b.
        Let ii be 1.
        While the value of ii is less than or equal to input dim,
            Let himo be the value of hi minus 1.
            Let wpos be the value of himo times input dim plus ii.
            Let hw be item wpos of hidden wts.
            Let ctr be the value of hw times dh.
            Let old de be item ii of d emb.
            Let new de be the value of old de plus ctr.
            Set item ii of d emb to the value of new de.
            Add 1 to ii.
        End while.
        Add 1 to hi.
    End while.
    Let ci be 1.
    While the value of ci is less than or equal to ctx,
        Let tok be item ci of ctx tokens.
        Let tokmo be the value of tok minus 1.
        Let emb off be the value of tokmo times embed dim.
        Let ei be 1.
        While the value of ei is less than or equal to embed dim,
            Let cimo be the value of ci minus 1.
            Let iv idx be the value of cimo times embed dim plus ei.
            Let de be item iv idx of d emb.
            Let epos be the value of emb off plus ei.
            Let old e be item epos of embed wts.
            Let e step be the value of de times lr.
            Let new e be the value of old e minus e step.
            Set item epos of embed wts to the value of new e.
            Add 1 to ei.
        End while.
        Add 1 to ci.
    End while.
End define.

Note, Compute coherence.
Define compute coherence,
    Let num toks be the length of token ids.
    Let min pos be the value of ctx plus 1.
    If the value of num toks is less than or equal to min pos,
        Set coherence val to 0.
        Return 0.
    End if.
    Let matches be 0.
    Let checks be 0.
    Let ti be the value of min pos.
    Let max checks be 50.
    While the value of ti is less than or equal to num toks,
        If the value of checks is greater than or equal to max checks,
            Set ti to the value of num toks plus 1.
        End if.
        If the value of checks is less than max checks,
            Create a list called nct.
            Let ci be 1.
            While the value of ci is less than or equal to ctx,
                Let off be the value of ti minus ctx plus ci minus 1.
                Let tid be item off of token ids.
                Add the value of tid to nct.
                Add 1 to ci.
            End while.
            Set ctx tokens to the value of nct.
            Call do forward.
            Let expected be item ti of token ids.
            Let best idx be 1.
            Let best prob be item 1 of probs.
            Let pi be 2.
            While the value of pi is less than or equal to vocab sz,
                Let p be item pi of probs.
                If the value of p is greater than best prob,
                    Set best idx to the value of pi.
                    Set best prob to the value of p.
                End if.
                Add 1 to pi.
            End while.
            If the value of best idx is equal to expected,
                Add 1 to matches.
            End if.
            Add 1 to checks.
            Add 1 to ti.
        End if.
    End while.
    If the value of checks is greater than 0,
        Set coherence val to the value of matches divided by checks.
    Otherwise,
        Set coherence val to 0.
    End if.
End define.

Note, Predict next token using argmax.
Define predict next,
    Let best idx be 1.
    Let best prob be item 1 of probs.
    Let ki be 2.
    While the value of ki is less than or equal to vocab sz,
        Let p be item ki of probs.
        If the value of p is greater than best prob,
            Set best idx to the value of ki.
            Set best prob to the value of p.
        End if.
        Add 1 to ki.
    End while.
    Return the value of best idx.
End define.

Note, Background training loop.
Define do training loop,
    Let num toks be the length of token ids.
    Let min pos be the value of ctx plus 1.
    Let si be 1.
    While the value of si is less than or equal to total steps,
        If the value of should halt is equal to yes,
            Set si to the value of total steps plus 1.
        End if.
        If the value of should halt is equal to no,
            Let simo be the value of si minus 1.
            Let max simo be the value of total steps minus 1.
            If the value of max simo is less than 1,
                Set max simo to 1.
            End if.
            Let decay frac be the value of simo divided by max simo.
            Let decay amt be the value of 0 point 5 times decay frac.
            Let decay factor be the value of 1 minus decay amt.
            Let step lr be the value of learn rate times decay factor divided by batch sz.
            Set current lr to the value of step lr.
            Let total loss be 0.
            Let bi be 1.
            While the value of bi is less than or equal to batch sz,
                Let pos be a random number between the value of min pos and the value of num toks.
                Create a list called nct.
                Let ci be 1.
                While the value of ci is less than or equal to ctx,
                    Let off be the value of pos minus ctx plus ci minus 1.
                    Let tid be item off of token ids.
                    Add the value of tid to nct.
                    Add 1 to ci.
                End while.
                Set ctx tokens to the value of nct.
                Let tgt be item pos of token ids.
                Call do forward.
                Let target prob be item tgt of probs.
                If the value of target prob is less than 0 point 0000001,
                    Set target prob to 0 point 0000001.
                End if.
                Let loss be the logarithm of the value of target prob.
                Set loss to the value of loss times negative 1.
                Set total loss to the value of total loss plus loss.
                Call do backward with the value of tgt and the value of step lr.
                Add 1 to bi.
            End while.
            Set epoch loss to the value of total loss divided by batch sz.
            Set current step to the value of si.
            Add the value of epoch loss to all losses.
            Let check coh be the value of si remainder 100.
            If the value of check coh is equal to 0,
                Call compute coherence.
            End if.
            Add the value of coherence val to all cohs.
            If the value of halt mode is equal to loss,
                If the value of epoch loss is less than or equal to target loss val,
                    Set should halt to yes.
                End if.
            End if.
            Add 1 to si.
        End if.
    End while.
    Set all done to yes.
    Set now training to no.
    Say Training complete at step the value of current step.
End define.

Note, API POST api train handler.
Define handle api train that takes req,
    If the value of now training is equal to yes,
        Create a dictionary called err resp.
        Set the entry the value of kerror in err resp to Already training.
        Respond with the value of err resp.
        Return 0.
    End if.
    Let cfg be the entry the value of kdata in req.
    If the value of cfg has the entry the value of ktext,
        Set training text to the entry the value of ktext in cfg.
    End if.
    If the value of cfg has the entry the value of kvocablimit,
        Let rv be the entry the value of kvocablimit in cfg.
        Set vocab limit to the number of rv.
    End if.
    If the value of cfg has the entry the value of kwholetokens,
        Let rv be the entry the value of kwholetokens in cfg.
        Set whole tok to the number of rv.
    End if.
    If the value of cfg has the entry the value of kminpaircount,
        Let rv be the entry the value of kminpaircount in cfg.
        Set min pair cnt to the number of rv.
    End if.
    If the value of cfg has the entry the value of kcontext,
        Let rv be the entry the value of kcontext in cfg.
        Set ctx to the number of rv.
    End if.
    If the value of cfg has the entry the value of kembeddim,
        Let rv be the entry the value of kembeddim in cfg.
        Set embed dim to the number of rv.
    End if.
    If the value of cfg has the entry the value of khiddendim,
        Let rv be the entry the value of khiddendim in cfg.
        Set hidden dim to the number of rv.
    End if.
    If the value of cfg has the entry the value of ksteps,
        Let rv be the entry the value of ksteps in cfg.
        Set num steps to the number of rv.
    End if.
    If the value of cfg has the entry the value of kbatchsize,
        Let rv be the entry the value of kbatchsize in cfg.
        Set batch sz to the number of rv.
    End if.
    If the value of cfg has the entry the value of klearningrate,
        Let rv be the entry the value of klearningrate in cfg.
        Set learn rate to the number of rv.
    End if.
    If the value of cfg has the entry the value of kstopmode,
        Set halt mode to the entry the value of kstopmode in cfg.
    End if.
    If the value of cfg has the entry the value of ktargetloss,
        Let rv be the entry the value of ktargetloss in cfg.
        Set target loss val to the number of rv.
    End if.
    If the value of cfg has the entry the value of ksemanticinit,
        Let rv be the entry the value of ksemanticinit in cfg.
        Set sem flag to the number of rv.
    End if.
    If the value of cfg has the entry the value of ksemanticanchor,
        Set sem anchor to the entry the value of ksemanticanchor in cfg.
    End if.
    If the value of cfg has the entry the value of ksemanticscale,
        Let rv be the entry the value of ksemanticscale in cfg.
        Set sem scale to the number of rv.
    End if.
    Let tlen be the length of training text.
    If the value of tlen is equal to 0,
        Create a dictionary called err resp.
        Let err msg be Missing training text.
        Set the entry the value of kerror in err resp to the value of err msg.
        Respond with the value of err resp.
        Return 0.
    End if.
    Call build vocab.
    If the value of vocab sz is less than 2,
        Create a dictionary called err resp.
        Set the entry the value of kerror in err resp to Vocabulary too small.
        Respond with the value of err resp.
        Return 0.
    End if.
    Call init model.
    If the value of sem flag is equal to 1,
        Call do semantic init.
    End if.
    Set now training to yes.
    Set should halt to no.
    Set all done to no.
    Set current step to 0.
    Set total steps to the value of num steps.
    Set epoch loss to 0.
    Set coherence val to 0.
    Set current lr to the value of learn rate.
    Create a list called all losses.
    Create a list called all cohs.
    Run do training loop in background.
    Create a dictionary called resp.
    Set the entry the value of kvocabsz in resp to the value of vocab sz.
    Set the entry the value of ktotaltokens in resp to the value of total toks.
    Set the entry the value of kparams in resp to the value of param count.
    Respond with the value of resp.
End define.

Note, API GET api progress handler.
Define handle api progress that takes req,
    Create a dictionary called resp.
    Set the entry the value of kstep in resp to the value of current step.
    Set the entry the value of ktotal in resp to the value of total steps.
    Set the entry the value of kloss in resp to the value of epoch loss.
    Set the entry the value of kcoh in resp to the value of coherence val.
    Set the entry the value of klr in resp to the value of current lr.
    Set the entry the value of klosses in resp to the value of all losses.
    Set the entry the value of kcohs in resp to the value of all cohs.
    Set the entry the value of kdone in resp to the value of all done.
    If the value of all done is equal to yes,
        Set the entry the value of kvocab in resp to the value of vocab words.
    End if.
    Respond with the value of resp.
End define.

Note, API POST api stop handler.
Define handle api halt that takes req,
    Set should halt to yes.
    Create a dictionary called resp.
    Set the entry the value of kmsg in resp to Stopping.
    Respond with the value of resp.
End define.

Note, API POST api save handler.
Define handle api save that takes req,
    If the value of vocab sz is less than 1,
        Create a dictionary called err resp.
        Let err msg be Model not trained yet.
        Set the entry the value of kerror in err resp to the value of err msg.
        Respond with the value of err resp.
        Return 0.
    End if.
    Open a database called word predictor.
    Create a table called vocab with columns word and idx.
    Create a table called config with columns key and val.
    Create a table called embeddings with columns pos and val.
    Create a table called hiddenw with columns pos and val.
    Create a table called hiddenb with columns pos and val.
    Create a table called outputw with columns pos and val.
    Create a table called outputb with columns pos and val.
    Delete from vocab where idx is not equal to negative 1.
    Delete from config where val is not equal to negative 1.
    Delete from embeddings where pos is not equal to negative 1.
    Delete from hiddenw where pos is not equal to negative 1.
    Delete from hiddenb where pos is not equal to negative 1.
    Delete from outputw where pos is not equal to negative 1.
    Delete from outputb where pos is not equal to negative 1.
    Let vi be 1.
    While the value of vi is less than or equal to vocab sz,
        Let w be item vi of vocab words.
        Insert into vocab the values the value of w and the value of vi.
        Add 1 to vi.
    End while.
    Insert into config the values vocabsize and the value of vocab sz.
    Insert into config the values context and the value of ctx.
    Insert into config the values embeddim and the value of embed dim.
    Insert into config the values hiddendim and the value of hidden dim.
    Insert into config the values inputdim and the value of input dim.
    Insert into config the values steps and the value of current step.
    Insert into config the values learnrate and the value of learn rate.
    Insert into config the values finalloss and the value of epoch loss.
    Let total e be the value of vocab sz times embed dim.
    Let wi be 1.
    While the value of wi is less than or equal to total e,
        Let w be item wi of embed wts.
        Insert into embeddings the values the value of wi and the value of w.
        Add 1 to wi.
    End while.
    Let total h be the value of hidden dim times input dim.
    Let wi be 1.
    While the value of wi is less than or equal to total h,
        Let w be item wi of hidden wts.
        Insert into hiddenw the values the value of wi and the value of w.
        Add 1 to wi.
    End while.
    Let wi be 1.
    While the value of wi is less than or equal to hidden dim,
        Let w be item wi of hidden bias.
        Insert into hiddenb the values the value of wi and the value of w.
        Add 1 to wi.
    End while.
    Let total o be the value of vocab sz times hidden dim.
    Let wi be 1.
    While the value of wi is less than or equal to total o,
        Let w be item wi of out wts.
        Insert into outputw the values the value of wi and the value of w.
        Add 1 to wi.
    End while.
    Let wi be 1.
    While the value of wi is less than or equal to vocab sz,
        Let w be item wi of out bias.
        Insert into outputb the values the value of wi and the value of w.
        Add 1 to wi.
    End while.
    Close the database.
    Create a dictionary called resp.
    Set the entry the value of kmsg in resp to Model saved to database.
    Respond with the value of resp.
End define.

Note, API GET api generate handler.
Define handle api gen that takes req,
    If the value of vocab sz is less than 1,
        Create a dictionary called err resp.
        Let err msg be Model not loaded.
        Set the entry the value of kerror in err resp to the value of err msg.
        Respond with the value of err resp.
        Return 0.
    End if.
    Let seed word be the entry the value of kseed in req.
    Let gen count be the entry the value of kcount in req.
    Let max words be the number of gen count.
    Let seed lower be the lowercase of seed word.
    If not the value of vocab map has the entry the value of seed lower,
        Create a dictionary called err resp.
        Set the entry the value of kerror in err resp to Unknown word.
        Respond with the value of err resp.
        Return 0.
    End if.
    Let seed idx be the entry the value of seed lower in vocab map.
    Create a list called history.
    Let fi be 1.
    While the value of fi is less than or equal to ctx,
        Add the value of seed idx to history.
        Add 1 to fi.
    End while.
    Create a list called gen words.
    Add the value of seed lower to gen words.
    Let wi be 1.
    While the value of wi is less than or equal to max words,
        Create a list called nct.
        Let hlen be the length of history.
        Let ci be 1.
        While the value of ci is less than or equal to ctx,
            Let off be the value of hlen minus ctx plus ci.
            Let tid be item off of history.
            Add the value of tid to nct.
            Add 1 to ci.
        End while.
        Set ctx tokens to the value of nct.
        Call do forward.
        Call predict next and store the result in next idx.
        Let next word be item next idx of vocab words.
        Add the value of next word to gen words.
        Add the value of next idx to history.
        Add 1 to wi.
    End while.
    Let output be item 1 of gen words.
    Let oi be 2.
    While the value of oi is less than or equal to the length of gen words,
        Let w be item oi of gen words.
        Set output to the value of output joined with space joined with w.
        Add 1 to oi.
    End while.
    Create a dictionary called resp.
    Set the entry the value of ktext in resp to the value of output.
    Respond with the value of resp.
End define.

Note, Set up webserver and routes.
Enable CORS.
Serve static files from the folder public.
Add route GET slash api slash progress to handle api progress.
Add route POST slash api slash train to handle api train.
Add route POST slash api slash stop to handle api halt.
Add route POST slash api slash save to handle api save.
Add route GET slash api slash generate to handle api gen.
Start a webserver on port 8080.
Wait for connections.
